	<section_number>15.2-5700</section_number>
	<catch_line>Short title; application</catch_line>
	<text>
		This chapter shall be known and may be cited as the "Park Authorities Act." The chapter shall apply to all localities of the Commonwealth.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 15-714.1; 1950, p. 1244; 1952, c. 401; 1962, c. 623, § 15.1-1228; 1997, c. 587.</history>
